## Favicon source files

All favicon bundles are in the sibling repo:

`badboards-site/favicons/<site>/`

Each bundle has 4 files: `favicon.svg`, `favicon.ico`, `favicon-16x16.png`, `apple-touch-icon.png`.

| Favicon folder | Site |
|----------------|------|
| `toolkit-badboards` | toolkit.badboards.org |
| `civiccongruence` | civiccongruence.org |
| `decathecting` | decathecting.com |
| `honor-flight` | honor-flight / keristokstadwrites.com |
| `communitymediavoices` | communitymediavoices.org (optional) |
| `orrerymap` | orrerymap.com (optional) |

**Done already:** badboards.org, keristokstad.com

## Favicon task (only these files)

For site `<TARGET>`:

1. Copy 4 files from `badboards-site/favicons/<site>/` → `<TARGET>/public/` (or site root if no public folder)
2. Add 3 lines to `<TARGET>/index.html` (or layout metadata) after `<title>`:

```html
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png" />
```

3. Commit and push. **Do not edit any other files.**

## If you cannot find a folder

Ask the user: "What is the exact folder name in the sidebar for [site]?" — do not search elsewhere.
